===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|ballokes|pos=plural of {{m|enm|ballok}}}}, from {{inh|en|ang|beallucas|pos=nominative plural of {{m|ang|bealluc}}}}. {{surf|en|bollock|-s|id2=regular plural}}. Compare {{m|en|cullion}}.

