{{en-noun|p|sg=bollock}}

# {{lb|en|UK|Ireland|Commonwealth|vulgar}} The [[testicle]]s (''sometimes used in the singular'')
#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:testicles}}
# {{lb|en|UK|Ireland|Commonwealth|vulgar}} Nonsense or information deliberately intended to mislead.
#: {{syn|en|Thesaurus:nonsense}}
#: {{uxi|en|That's a load of '''bollocks''', mate!}}
